{
  "$format": "janus-conformance-case/1",
  "id": "facade/pact-js-async-messages",
  "category": "facade",
  "facade": "pact-js",
  "title": "An asynchronous message is handed to the test with no mock, its contents as JSON, as octets, or through a body handler.",
  "covers": [],
  "rows": [
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`addAsynchronousInteraction()`: `given`, `expectsToReceive(description, builder)`, `withJSONContent`, `withMetadata`, `withMatchingRules`, `executeTest`"
    },
    { "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md", "row": "A message's `contentType` metadata" },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`withContent(contentType, buffer)` on a message, `MessageConsumerPact`'s `withBinaryContent`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`synchronousBodyHandler`, `asynchronousBodyHandler`, `v4SynchronousBodyHandler`, `v4AsynchronousBodyHandler`"
    }
  ],
  "why": "consumer-test-migration.md, pact-js: `addAsynchronousInteraction()`'s calls are kept, and `executeTest`'s function is handed the message, its JSON contents as their document and octets as a `Buffer`, with no mock started (ADR 0067); a message's `contentType` metadata is compared as a media type (ADR 0071).",
  "note": "`MessageConsumerPact`'s `withBinaryContent`, and the V3 body handlers, are facade/pact-js-message-consumer-pact's.",
  "subjects": { "typescript": "pact-js-async-messages.ts" },
  "expect": {
    "tests": [{ "test": "jsonContents" }, { "test": "octetContents" }, { "test": "bodyHandlers" }],
    "contracts": {
      "web-app-orders-api.janus.json": {
        "content": {
          "interactions": [
            {
              "description": "an order delivered event",
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": { "event": { "example": "an order delivered event", "shape": "equality" } },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "contentType": {
                        "of": {
                          "example": "application/json",
                          "pattern": "^\\s*(?i:application)/(?:[^;]*\\+)?(?i:json)\\s*(?:;.*)?$",
                          "shape": "regex"
                        },
                        "shape": "optional"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "an order image event",
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": { "encoded": "base64", "example": "iVBORw==", "shape": "equality" },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "contentType": {
                        "of": {
                          "example": "image/png",
                          "pattern": "^\\s*(?i:image)/(?:[^;]*\\+)?(?i:png)\\s*(?:;.*)?$",
                          "shape": "regex"
                        },
                        "shape": "optional"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "an order placed event",
              "states": [{ "name": "an order was placed", "params": { "id": 1 } }],
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "id": { "example": 1, "shape": "integer" },
                      "sku": { "example": "A-1", "shape": "type" }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "contentType": {
                        "shape": "http:media-type",
                        "type": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
                        "example": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                      },
                      "topic": { "example": "orders", "shape": "equality" }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "an order shipped event",
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": { "event": { "example": "an order shipped event", "shape": "equality" } },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "contentType": {
                        "of": {
                          "example": "application/json",
                          "pattern": "^\\s*(?i:application)/(?:[^;]*\\+)?(?i:json)\\s*(?:;.*)?$",
                          "shape": "regex"
                        },
                        "shape": "optional"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
